const blankAssignmentsForMonth=month=>{const [year,monthNumber]=month.split('-').map(Number),assignments=[];for(const date=new Date(year,monthNumber-1,1,12);date.getMonth()===monthNumber-1;date.setDate(date.getDate()+1)){const day=date.getDay();for(const turn of db.turns.filter(item=>item.active&&item.days.includes(day)))for(const resource of db.resources.filter(item=>item.active))assignments.push({id:uid(),date:calendarLocalIso(date),turnId:turn.id,resourceId:resource.id,participantIds:[],origin:'en blanco',protected:false,unassignedAccepted:false})}return assignments};
